iew Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you want one that approves or disapproves of your lifestyle?</div> </div> </div> </div>Both could be fine","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My English sucks. Sorry.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23549-toreadorgentleman","name":"ToreadorGentleman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T15:07:32-07:00","id":1198857,"title":"","content":"Somebody loud and shocking, with a general dislike of society...<br /> <br /> Have you considered Ares? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 03-23-2018, 06:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T15:27:09-07:00","id":1198866,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ToreadorGentleman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1198838-god-choice#post1198838\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My character is an anarchist punk bassist and singer. <br /> A bit stereotyped, to say the truth<br /> <br /> What God should I choose as his parent?</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean... I advocate not feeling too confined to parallel your Scion and their parent. The Born are the Scions most free to be different (by comparison, the Chosen need to be selected for some reason for the God, so there\u2019s presumably something they like; and the Incarnate are the God!)<br /> <br /> If you want a god who is like your Scion, I\u2019d recommend Dionysus; who is patron of overturning social orders and setting yourself as \u201cother\u201d. Probably take Chaos as your inherent Purview. Get an instrument from him as your relic that can include Artistry and Passion.<br /> <br /> Odin would also be a good fit. He also was patron of mad ecstasy, though not as overtly as Dionysus. With him the link to your father is probably in his role as god of Poetry and it\u2019s secret wisdom, so take Artistry as your inherent Purview.<br /> <br /> When we get the Anunna - Inanna/Ishtar will be a good fit, but they\u2019re still a bit off.<br /> <br /> Or cast your Scion as an overt rebel against their parent, shaping their fuck-the-authority worldview, and go with an Order god!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T15:49:38-07:00","id":1198871,"title":"","c